## Adversarial probes
- misleading_success_output: the boot REACHED MULTI-USER — `Reached target Multi-User System` +
  `antagony login:` prompt quoted, not merely "no failure lines".
- stale_state: booted the NEW store path from the NEW ISO (`9bqrwpqy…` / system `0gwn2sk…`);
  its activate has no validator.
- dirty_worktree: `git show --stat HEAD` = only modules/flake/iso-images.nix (+23/-1) and
  tests/iso-autostart-vm.nix (+8/-36).
- hung_or_long_commands: all builds/boots under `timeout` (3000/3600/400 s).
- flaky_tests: (a) is deterministic; re-run post-reboot -> `BUILD_RC=0` again.

